<title>USA: Investor holds 7.5 pct Professional stake.</title>
<headline>Investor holds 7.5 pct Professional stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patricia Niehoff, a Cincinnati, Ohio, investor, said Tuesday she holds a 7.5 percent stake or 97,571 common shares in Professional Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Niehoff said the stake consists of 85,500 shares for which she paid $957,968 and 9,071 shares received as stock dividends.</p>
<p>She said she holds the stake for investment.</p>
</text>
